vant rules/orders.</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">(ii) In the case of ordinary advance twelve months have elapsed since the full repayment of the previous temporary advance.</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">(iii) The amount drawn does not exceed the amount at my credit on this date, Policy no._____has been accepted by the Accountant General, U. P., vide his letter no._____dated_____</p>\n<p align=\"RIGHT\">Dated, Signature of the Officer_____</p>\n<p align=\"RIGHT\">Designation____________________</p>\n</font><font color=\"#008080\" size=\"5\"><p align=\"CENTER\">(A) IN CASE OF PAYMENT AT THE TREASURY</p>\n</font><font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">*Pay Rs. (\t\t\t)_____</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Examined and entered.</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">\t\t\tAccountant</p></font>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"641\">\n<tr><td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"50%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Dated_____19   .</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"50%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Treasury Officer.</p></font></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<font color=\"#008080\" size=\"5\"><p align=\"CENTER\">(B) IN CASE OF PAYMENT AT THE BANK</p>\n</font><font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">To</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">\tTHE AGENT, STATE BANK OF INDIA_____</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Please pay *Rs. (\t\t\t)_____Treasury.</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Dated_____\tTreasury Officer.</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">_____</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">PAYEES’ DISCHARGE TO THE BANK</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Received payment.</p>\n<p align=\"RIGHT\">Name_____</p>\n<p align=\"RIGHT\">Officer_____</p>\n</font><font color=\"#008080\" size=\"5\"><p align=\"CENTER\">FOR USE IN ACCOUNTANT GENERAL’S OFFICE</p>\n</font><font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Admitted for Rs.</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Objected to Rs.</p></font>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"641\">\